rotect someone you should have condemned. The passengers remember what you say and what you do.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiple Endings</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Save the damned, or judge them.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices shape every ending. Each run reveals something the last one hid.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >You will love GrimRail if you're a fan of:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SOMA</strong>, existential horror and shifting realities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dishonored</strong>, immersive sim depth and player agency</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disco Elysium</strong>, dialogue-driven moral choices</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mouthwashing</strong>, surreal psychological storytelling</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The world remembers what you did.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wishlist GrimRail.</strong></p>", "short_description": "Step aboard Grimrail, a story-rich psychological horror immersive-sim set on a purgatorial train. Using a cosmic radio fused to your wrist, tune into the memories of the past, confront or avoid abominations, and harness powerful eldritch abilities to navigate this liminal nightmare world.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/dbc1187b98f8a4452134d78b95118ecec4084270/header.jpg?t=1779241982", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/1d667fa34a73d9c415775abfc1b5c089b2e1b027/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779241982", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3975300/1d667fa34a73d9c415775abfc1b5c089b2e1b027/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779241982", "website": "https: